; Synthetic survey whose block keeps its capital under *case preserve: cavern
; labels its stations Foo.P1, Foo.P2 and Foo.P3. The anonymous outer block
; keeps the *case setting from reaching whatever follows the *include.
; Nothing fixes it.
*begin
*case preserve
*begin Foo
*data normal from to tape compass clino
P1 P2 10 90 0
P2 P3 10 0 0
*end Foo
*end
